{"organizations": [], "uuid": "d57cf5a612e35bf4255557585ce4f341dffdc522", "thread": {"social": {"gplus": {"shares": 0}, "pinterest": {"shares": 0}, "vk": {"shares": 0}, "linkedin": {"shares": 0}, "facebook": {"likes": 0, "shares": 0, "comments": 0}, "stumbledupon": {"shares": 0}}, "site_full": "hk.finance.yahoo.com", "main_image": "https://s.yimg.com/uu/api/res/1.2/JhwCn4iaZAXVaoG050lLQw--~B/aD04NTM7dz0xMjgwO3NtPTE7YXBwaWQ9eXRhY2h5b24-/http://media.zenfs.com/en/homerun/feed_manager_auto_publish_494/653c26b768d3c25fb1150601f6527ba0", "site_section": "https://hk.finance.yahoo.com/news/provider-wsj", "section_title": "Yahoo 財經：商業財經、股票市場、報價、新聞", "url": "https://hk.finance.yahoo.com/news/%E3%80%90%E5%8A%A0%E5%85%A5%E6%88%B0%E5%9C%98%E3%80%91youtube%E5%B0%87%E5%9C%A85%E6%9C%8822%E6%97%A5%E6%8E%A8%E5%87%BA%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%84%E9%9F%B3%E6%A8%82%E6%B5%81%E5%AA%92%E9%AB%94%E6%9C%8D%E5%8B%99-070943736.html", "country": "", "domain_rank": 5, "title": "【加入戰團】YouTube將在5月22日推出新的音樂流媒體服務", "performance_score": 0, "site": "yahoo.com", "participants_count": 1, "title_full": "", "spam_score": 0.0, "site_type": "news", "published": "2018-05-17T15:09:00.000+03:00", "replies_count": 0, "uuid": "d57cf5a612e35bf4255557585ce4f341dffdc522"}, "author": "華爾街日報", "url": "https://hk.finance.yahoo.com/news/%E3%80%90%E5%8A%A0%E5%85%A5%E6%88%B0%E5%9C%98%E3%80%91youtube%E5%B0%87%E5%9C%A85%E6%9C%8822%E6%97%A5%E6%8E%A8%E5%87%BA%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%84%E9%9F%B3%E6%A8%82%E6%B5%81%E5%AA%92%E9%AB%94%E6%9C%8D%E5%8B%99-070943736.html", "ord_in_thread": 0, "title": "【加入戰團】YouTube將在5月22日推出新的音樂流媒體服務", "locations": [], "entities": {"persons": [], "locations": [], "organizations": []}, "highlightText": "", "language": "chineset", "persons": [], "text": "圖片來源：REUTERS 更多 Google表示，旗下YouTube部門將於5月22日推出一款新的音樂流媒體服務YouTube Music。\nYouTube於周三在其官方網誌發表的聲明中表示，新服務將包括一款重新設計的手機應用程式以及一款全新的音樂播放器。\nYouTube表示，該服務的特色是涵蓋數千條播放列表、數百萬首正版歌曲、專輯、歌手及網絡電台等。該公司表示，新服務將在美國、澳洲、新西蘭、墨西哥和韓國推出，並在接下來數星期擴展至更多地區。\nYouTube指出，粉絲們可以免費使用帶廣告的新YouTube Music，同時該公司也將推出付費版YouTube Music Premium，付費會員每月只要支付9.99美元就可以享受後台播放、下載和無廣告等功能。\n此外，YouTube表示，其YouTube Red訂閱服務現已更名為YouTube Premium，將包括YouTube Music和現有的YouTube Red視頻節目。Google母公司是Alphabet Inc. (GOOG)。\n憑藉即將推出的這一服務，該公司將進一步深入早已被其他重量級公司佔據的市場。今年較早時候，總部位於斯德哥爾摩的音樂流媒體服務商Spotify Technology SA (SPOT)於紐約上市，而對於蘋果公司(Apple Inc., AAPL)來說，音樂早已成為其重要服務部門的主要支柱。YouTube Red的競爭對手還包括Netflix Inc. (NFLX)和亞馬遜(Amazon.com Inc., AMZN)等公司的視頻訂閱服務。\n特朗普稱並未在中興問題上向中國軟化\n美國議員稱美國技術被中國用於監控國內民眾\n中美進口關稅差異有多大？\n朝鮮對只關注去核問題的朝美峰會不感興趣\n騰訊如何投資布局擠出競爭對手？", "external_links": ["https://cn.wsj.com/articles/CT-BIZ-20180516125844", "https://cn.wsj.com/articles/CT-BGH-20180517073945&quot;", "https://cn.wsj.com/articles/CT-BIZ-20180516125844&quot;", "https://cn.wsj.com/articles/CT-FIN-20180516085756&quot;", "https://cn.wsj.com/articles/CT-BGH-20180516111720&quot;", "https://cn.wsj.com/articles/CT-BGH-20180517073945", "https://s.yimg.com/ny/api/res/1.2/Eos2j.HxwP39gPthNbDIlw--/YXBwaWQ9aGlnaGxhbmRlcjtzbT0xO3c9NjE0O2g9NDA5/http://media.zenfs.com/en/homerun/feed_manager_auto_publish_494/653c26b768d3c25fb1150601f6527ba0", "https://cn.wsj.com/articles/CT-BGH-20180516073439", "https://cn.wsj.com/articles/CT-BGH-20180516073439&quot;", "https://cn.wsj.com/articles/CT-FIN-20180516085756", "https://cn.wsj.com/articles/CT-BGH-20180516111720"], "published": "2018-05-17T15:09:00.000+03:00", "crawled": "2018-05-22T19:49:55.017+03:00", "highlightTitle": ""}